{"unit_id":"SeverusZh__dsh-notify-windows#card-zh","repo":"SeverusZh/dsh-notify-windows","commit":"112194f5eea16748a142c42f914ae044a8df18e4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-windows 是 DSH 的 Windows 桌面通知插件。它监听 Cordis session/event，并用 Windows PowerShell 的 WinRT Toast API 提醒回合完成、审批等待和 Agent 提问。完成通知可附最后回复摘要；默认过滤子代理及 /goal 中间轮次，审批策略为 never 时静默。通知可点击打开 DSH Web 界面，文案支持中、英、俄及自定义覆盖。适合后台运行 DSH、希望及时处理待办的 Windows 用户；无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:312-332","lib/index.js:458-535","lib/notify.ps1:27-99","cordis.patch.yml:12-14"]}
{"unit_id":"SeverusZh__dsh-notify-windows#card-en","repo":"SeverusZh/dsh-notify-windows","commit":"112194f5eea16748a142c42f914ae044a8df18e4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify-windows sends Windows toasts for DSH completions, approvals, and questions. It uses Cordis events and PowerShell WinRT. Alerts may include reply excerpts; subagents and non-final /goal rounds stay quiet. Click to open DSH. Messages support Chinese, English, Russian. No API key needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:312-332","lib/index.js:458-535","lib/notify.ps1:27-99","lib/launcher.ps1:71-93","cordis.patch.yml:12-14"]}
