{"unit_id":"SeverusZh__dsh-notify-windows#feature-1","repo":"SeverusZh/dsh-notify-windows","commit":"112194f5eea16748a142c42f914ae044a8df18e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-windows 的功能「回合结束通知」：监听 turn/end 并按完成、错误或 token 上限原因提醒。通知可带轮次和最后一条助手回复摘要，摘要长度可配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:465-493"]}
{"unit_id":"SeverusZh__dsh-notify-windows#feature-2","repo":"SeverusZh/dsh-notify-windows","commit":"112194f5eea16748a142c42f914ae044a8df18e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-windows 的功能「审批提醒」：收到 approval/asked 时通知用户，正文包含工具名和原因；会话审批策略为 never 时跳过，因为没有待处理的用户审批。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:497-520"]}
{"unit_id":"SeverusZh__dsh-notify-windows#feature-3","repo":"SeverusZh/dsh-notify-windows","commit":"112194f5eea16748a142c42f914ae044a8df18e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-windows 的功能「待回答问题提醒」：检测 ask_user_question 工具调用，也扫描 run_code 源码中的嵌套调用；通知正文展示提取到的问题，无法提取时使用兜底文案。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:192-222","lib/index.js:523-542"]}
{"unit_id":"SeverusZh__dsh-notify-windows#feature-4","repo":"SeverusZh/dsh-notify-windows","commit":"112194f5eea16748a142c42f914ae044a8df18e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-windows 的功能「减少干扰」：默认过滤子代理会话，并让 /goal 自动推进的中间回合保持安静；目标完成或阻塞的终态回合仍可触发提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:443-475"]}
{"unit_id":"SeverusZh__dsh-notify-windows#feature-5","repo":"SeverusZh/dsh-notify-windows","commit":"112194f5eea16748a142c42f914ae044a8df18e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-windows 的功能「点击通知返回 DSH」：可点击的 toast 会带上会话 URL；Windows launcher 尝试导航已有 Chrome 标签或聚焦现有窗口，失败后打开默认浏览器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:357-399","lib/launcher.ps1:71-93","lib/launcher.ps1:165-208","lib/launcher.ps1:210-310"]}
{"unit_id":"SeverusZh__dsh-notify-windows#feature-6","repo":"SeverusZh/dsh-notify-windows","commit":"112194f5eea16748a142c42f914ae044a8df18e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-windows 的功能「多语言文案」：通知内置中文、英文和俄文消息包，并允许按消息键覆盖文案；未知语言回退到默认中文包。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:75-182"]}
{"unit_id":"SeverusZh__dsh-notify-windows#caveat-1","repo":"SeverusZh/dsh-notify-windows","commit":"112194f5eea16748a142c42f914ae044a8df18e4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"依赖 Windows PowerShell 5.1 与 WinRT Toast；WSL 下也需可用的 Windows PowerShell 通道。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:33-56","lib/notify.ps1:27-30"]}
{"unit_id":"SeverusZh__dsh-notify-windows#caveat-2","repo":"SeverusZh/dsh-notify-windows","commit":"112194f5eea16748a142c42f914ae044a8df18e4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-windows 默认记录通知诊断到系统临时目录；点击通知时会在当前用户 HKCU 注册 dshnotify 协议处理器，以便启动本地 launcher 并打开 DSH 页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:337-345","lib/notify.ps1:31-70"]}
